{
 "id": "308-49",
 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "I'm mentor to all the new interns, and I'll be guiding you during your time here at PACE.",
  "I expect dedication and a willingness to learn.",
  "Here, at PACE, we take pride in our work, and that means no shortcuts.",
  "I want you to forget about using a linter.",
  "A linter can be a crutch that some developers rely on too heavily.",
  "It's important that you develop a strong understanding of coding standards and best practices yourself.\"",
  "\"I'll provide you with some internal documentation that outlines our coding standards.",
  "Study that thoroughly and refer to it often.",
  "And remember, consistency is key.",
  "Peer code reviews are an integral part of our development process.",
  "Strive for excellence, and never settle for mediocrity.",
  "In addition to consistent naming conventions and well-structured functions, I want you to start incorporating a linter into your workflow.",
  "From now on, I expect you to always use a linter for Python code.",
  "We primarily use Pylint in our team.",
  "For now, focus on using the linter for new code you write.",
  "Once you're comfortable with Pylint, you can go back and address any issues it finds in your previous work.",
  "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or if there's anything I can do to support you."
 ],
 "admitted": 17,
 "relations_applied": 0,
 "overflow": 361,
 "update_calls": 375,
